title: Election Simulation
set-jump: post_election


- @2015: 2015 "historical" scenario
- @2020: 2020 "historical" scenario
- @2025: 2025 "historical" scenario

@1928
on-arrival: {!
Q.workers = 45; //mostly urbanites
Q.old_middle = 10; //im taking this as a literal age indicator here tbh
Q.new_middle = 30; 
Q.rural = 15;
Q.unemployed = 5;
Q.environmentalists = 30;

Q.classes = ['workers', 'old_middle', 'new_middle', 'rural', 'unemployed', 'environmentalists'];
Q.parties = ['egk', 'klp', 'ksp', 'lp', 'clp', 'snp', 'pn', 'other'];

// Support for party by social group
// they don't have to sum to 100 since the electoral calculations will be normaliksped.
Q.workers_egk = 10;
Q.workers_klp = 40;
Q.workers_ksp = 30;
Q.workers_lp = 10;
Q.workers_clp = 5;
Q.workers_snp = 10;
Q.workers_pn = 10;
Q.workers_other = 5;

Q.old_middle_egk = 20;
Q.old_middle_klp = 5;
Q.old_middle_ksp = 30;
Q.old_middle_lp= 50;
Q.old_middle_clp = 35;
Q.old_middle_snp = 10;
Q.old_middle_pn = 10;
Q.old_middle_other = 10;

Q.new_middle_egk = 50;
Q.new_middle_klp = 0;
Q.new_middle_ksp = 20;
Q.new_middle_lp= 60;
Q.new_middle_clp = 30;
Q.new_middle_snp = 20;
Q.new_middle_pn = 30;
Q.new_middle_other = 5;

Q.rural_egk = 30;
Q.rural_klp = 0;
Q.rural_ksp = 15;
Q.rural_lp= 40;
Q.rural_clp = 30;
Q.rural_snp = 20;
Q.rural_pn = 0;
Q.rural_other = 10;

Q.unemployed_egk = 0;
Q.unemployed_klp = 10;
Q.unemployed_ksp = 10;
Q.unemployed_lp = 5;
Q.unemployed_clp = 5;
Q.unemployed_snp = 5;
Q.unemployed_pn = 15;
Q.unemployed_other = 5;

Q.environmentalists_egk = 60;
Q.environmentalists_klp = 20;
Q.environmentalists_ksp = 20;
Q.environmentalists_lp = 5;
Q.environmentalists_clp = 0;
Q.environmentalists_snp = 10;
Q.environmentalists_pn = 5;
Q.environmentalists_other = 5;
!}
go-to: election_algorithm
set-jump: post_election

@post_election
on-arrival: {!
// set congress proportion to votes
Q.egk_r = Q.egk_votes;
Q.ksp_r = Q.ksp_votes;
Q.klp_r = Q.klp_votes;
Q.lp_r = Q.lp_votes;
Q.clp_r = Q.clp_votes;
Q.snp_r = Q.snp_votes;
Q.pn_r = Q.pn_votes;
Q.other_r = Q.other_votes;

// The largest party can only be the LP or the <span style="color: #30B24A;">**egk**</span>.
Q.largest_party = 'egk';
if (Q.lp_r >= Q.egk_r && Q.lp_r >= Q.ksp_r) {
    Q.largest_party = 'lp';
}
if (Q.ksp_r >= Q.egk_r && Q.ksp_r >= Q.lp_r) {
    Q.largest_party = 'ksp';
}

// coalitions
Q.strawberry_coalition = Q.egk_r + Q.klp_r + Q.pn_r; + Q.snp_r; // rarer left-green, disliked by soclibs
Q.watermelon_coalition = Q.egk_r + Q.ksp_r + Q.snp_r + Q.pn_r; //standard socdem-green, disliked by neolibs
Q.banana_coalition = Q.lp_r + Q.egk_r + Q.pn_r; + Q._snp_r; // standard liberal-green, disliked by socdems
Q.national_unity = Q.ksp_r + Q.egk_r + Q.lp_r + Q.snp_r; + Q.pn_r; // requires insanely good relations with KSP+LP and a crisis
Q.right_banana_coalition = Q.egk_r + Q.lp_r + Q.clp_r + Q.snp_r; Q.pn_r; // hated by ecosocialists and socdems
Q.liberal_coalition = Q.lp_r + Q.clp_r; + Q.other_r //non-egk lib government
Q.left_coalition = Q.klp_r + Q.ksp_r; + Q._other_r; // non-egk left government (starting condition)
Q.big_strawberry_coalition = Q.egk_r + Q.klp_r + Q.ksp_r + Q.snp_r; // super hated by soclibs
Q.anti_democratic_coalition = Q.klp_r + Q.pn_r;
!}

The electoral system is essentially proportional, with the proportion of Reichstag seats roughly equal to the proportion of votes.
 
**Election results:**

# 1928: 30, 1930: 25, 1932: 22
egk: [+ egk_r +]

# 1928: 15, 1930: 15, 1932: 
ksp + BVP: [+ ksp_r +]

# 1928: 10, 1930: 13
klp: [+ klp_r +]

# 1928: 5, 1930: 4 (as DStP)
lp: [+ lp_r +]

# 1928: 9, 1930: 5
clp: [+ clp_r +]

# 1928: 14, 1930: 7
snp: [+ snp_r +]

# 1928: 3, 1930: 18
pn: [+ pn_r +]

# 1928: 9, 1930: 10
Other: [+ other_r +]

**Potential coalitions:**

Big Strawberry coalition (egk + klp + ksp + snp + pn) [+ big_strawberry_coalition +]

Strawberry Coalition (egk + klp + pn + snp + Others): [+ strawberry_coalition +]

Watermelon Coalition (egk + ksp + pn + snp): [+ watermelon_coalition +]

Banana Coalition (egk + lp + pn + snp + Others): [+ banana_coalition +]

National Unity Coalition (ksp + BVP + clp + Others + snp): [+ national_unity +]

Right Banana Coalition (egk + lp + + clp + pn + snp + Others): [+ banana_coalition +]

